Z||000022||FieroLogun||05-17-2001||10:40 PM|||| No its not BS) I had the Northstar/twinturbo instaled by DESIGN 1 inhouse here is the link  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <A HREF="http://www.design1systems.com/northstar/index.html" TARGET=_blank>www.design1systems.com/northstar/index.html</A> <P> The heat is almost nonexistent, I'v never had it overheat.<P> It cost me around $15,000 but it was well worth it. 3,000 for the used Northstar 5,000 for the turbos 5,000 for NS/Turbo install and 2,000 for exaust and a few extras.<P> I think IRM? also does a Northstar/turbo install.<P> Hope this helps the sceptics <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
