Z||000027||stimpy||05-18-2001||08:55 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLogun:<BR><B> No its not BS) I had the Northstar/twinturbo instaled by DESIGN 1 inhouse. Hope this helps the sceptics   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>And how! Just so happens Design One is RIGHT HERE in Oklahoma City, and I'll be seeing Kevin Leslie TOMORROW at the Fiero Show. (I'm sure you recognize the name, after writing such a huge check to him) I'll drop your name to him, and I'm sure he'll remember you (after all, you did write such a large check.)<P>That'll settle it. <P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLogun:<BR><B> I think IRM? also does a Northstar/turbo install.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>One thing bothers me though, why did you send your car all the way to Oklahoma without even making sure IRM in Maryland either does or does not do biturbo Northstar swaps? I mean, I don't even buy <B>shoes</B> without looking a couple places to compare prices. Anyhow post or email me your name, Mr. Logun, and all this shall be settled manana.<p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 05-18-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000028||Slammed Fiero||05-18-2001||12:23 PM||||Oh What a tangled web we weave , when first we practice to decieve..<P>In other words I emailed Kevin Leslie at Design One and here is what he had to say:<P>Jonathan, turn key installs run about $15,000-$16,000 on a car that is<BR>mechanically sound(chassis) and not rusty.  The price varies depending <BR>on<BR>what I have to pay for the Powertrain and its mileage and <BR>specification.<BR>The 300 hp engines are $500-$1000 more than a 275 hp.  We think the 275 <BR>hp<BR>makes the best all around package.  We have been doing so many <BR>conversions<BR>that the turbo system has had to be put on a lower priority.  We will <BR>have<BR>something soon.  We have a lot more pictures that are not posted.  I <BR>can<BR>send a few if you like.<BR>Kevin Leslie<BR>Design 1 Systems<BR>405-733-5505 voice<BR>405-733-7725 fax<BR>kevin@design1systems.com <A HREF="http://www.design1systems.com" TARGET=_blank>www.design1systems.com</A> <BR>______________________________________<P>My car is slow ass and atleast I can admit it!! Sorry I'm a bit of an a**hole I know , but I just don't like false claims, a lot of people use this forum for accurate information and I can remember getting info when I first started off from people full of it and it caused some headaches/ problems with my baby. I always make sure to ask / plan before I do something and I rely on the forum for help. I have gotten off of 2 Fiero mailing lists because I find this form of information far easier.<P>Thank- you and have a good day<BR>Oh yeah ..0-60 high 6's , blazing the 1/4 in mid to high 15's yeee haa. Hold on ma.<P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
Z||000029||stimpy||05-18-2001||02:24 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JSocha:<BR><B>Hey!  I just seen black feathers!<P>Somebody here been eatin crow?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It's not on my menu. Maybe it'll be the latest rage in New York City. Good snoopin Jonathan.  I was wondering how Kevin was able to do a twin turbo install on a Northstar for the same price as a 2.8 single turbo install that he's been marketing for years. <P>Did anybody hear someone cry "wolf"?  <P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
